 "title": "O que é o ascendente?",
 "description": "Entenda o signo que mostra a primeira impressão que você causa nas pessoas.",
 "modified": "2026-11-17",
 "content": "<amp-story standalone=\"\" title=\"O que é o ascendente?\" publisher=\"Aurenstar\" publisher-logo-src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/logo-96.png\" poster-portrait-src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/poster-pt-o-que-e-o-ascendente.webp\"><amp-story-page id=\"cover\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-night.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:31.068%;height:6.011%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:22px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.645%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:55.191%;width:88.350%;height:31.694%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:58.470%;width:76.699%;height:10.383%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:4.372vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">O que é o ascendente?</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:69.945%;width:76.699%;height:9.836%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.322vh;font-weight:400;color:#647DA5;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Entenda o signo que mostra a primeira impressão que você causa nas pessoas.</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:81.694%;width:76.699%;height:3.005%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.913vh;font-weight:700;color:#E73578;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Toque para avançar →</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p1\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-night.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:31.068%;height:6.011%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:22px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.645%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:48.087%;width:88.350%;height:38.798%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:51.639%;width:23.786%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:52.459%;width:23.786%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">O que é</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:57.923%;width:76.699%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">O signo que subia no horizonte</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:68.579%;width:76.699%;height:14.754%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">No instante em que você nasceu, um signo estava nascendo no horizonte leste. Esse é o seu ascendente.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p2\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-air.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:31.068%;height:6.011%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:22px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.645%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:48.087%;width:88.350%;height:38.798%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:51.639%;width:52.913%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:52.459%;width:52.913%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">Como os outros veem</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:57.923%;width:76.699%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">A sua primeira impressão</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:68.579%;width:76.699%;height:14.754%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">O ascendente mostra como você chega: a postura, o tom de voz e a energia que as pessoas percebem logo de cara.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p3\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-fire.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:31.068%;height:6.011%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:22px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.645%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:39.754%;width:88.350%;height:47.131%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:43.306%;width:33.495%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:44.126%;width:33.495%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">Muda rápido</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:49.590%;width:76.699%;height:13.934%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Um novo signo a cada 2 horas, mais ou menos</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:64.891%;width:76.699%;height:18.443%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Por isso duas pessoas nascidas no mesmo dia podem ter ascendentes diferentes. Em média, cada signo sobe por cerca de 2 horas.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p4\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-water.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:31.068%;height:6.011%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:22px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.645%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:51.776%;width:88.350%;height:35.109%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:55.328%;width:43.204%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:56.148%;width:43.204%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">Precisa da hora</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:61.612%;width:76.699%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">A hora do nascimento faz diferença</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:72.268%;width:76.699%;height:11.066%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Sem a hora certa, o ascendente pode sair errado. Procure a hora na certidão de nascimento.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p5\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-earth.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:31.068%;height:6.011%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:22px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.645%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:44.399%;width:88.350%;height:42.486%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:47.951%;width:48.058%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:48.770%;width:48.058%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">Exemplo inventado</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:54.235%;width:76.699%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Sol em Leão, ascendente em Virgem</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:64.891%;width:76.699%;height:18.443%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Por dentro, a pessoa é expansiva e vaidosa. Por fora, parece reservada e organizada. O ascendente muda o jeito de aparecer.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"end\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-night.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:31.068%;height:6.011%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:22px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolut